          "name": "Get Feasibility",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get Feasibility",
            "description": {
              "content": "### Ask for a feasibility request\nAs of today, the API does not cover all cases properly meaning that it could answer that the request is feasible when it is not.</br>\nPlease take the following precautions :\n-\tONENOWATTEMPTS should be between 3 and 14 days\n-\tONEDAY should be on a time period where at least 1 acquisition is planned and maximum 1 day\n-\tIf you want to be sure, you can use the get attempts path (../api/v1/attempts)\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "protocol": "https",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "feasibility"
              ],
              "host": [
                "task",
                "api",
                "oneatlas",
                "airbus",
                "com"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"progTypeNames\": [\n    \"ONEPLAN\",\n    \"ONEPLAN\"\n  ],\n  \"mission\": \"<string>\",\n  \"contractId\": \"<string>\",\n  \"acquisitionDate\": {\n    \"startDate\": \"<datetime>\",\n    \"endDate\": \"<datetime>\"\n  },\n  \"optical\": {\n    \"acquisitionMode\": \"<string>\",\n    \"maxCloudCover\": \"<float>\",\n    \"maxIncidenceAngle\": \"<float>\"\n  },\n  \"aoi\": {\n    \"coordinates\": [\n      [\n        [\n          \"<number>\",\n          \"<number>\"\n        ],\n        [\n          \"<number>\",\n          \"<number>\"\n        ],\n        [\n          \"<number>\",\n          \"<number>\"\n        ],\n        [\n          \"<number>\",\n          \"<number>\"\n        ]\n      ]\n    ],\n    \"type\": \"<string>\"\n  }\n}",
